00:56:25.490 --> 00:56:28.130
Then you would rate each twins.

00:56:28.130 --> 00:56:29.620
Then you picked up the mean.

00:56:29.620 --> 00:56:30.730
It's called mean score.

00:56:30.730 --> 00:56:32.640
And there are many scores.

00:56:32.640 --> 00:56:38.720
And we trying to develop our
